 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Try to get there as fast as you can. If the bride still needs things like her makeup and brides dress, see if you can help out in the bathroom. Try to go just before they start, or at a moment when room is busy and the officiant isn't looking at you. Honestly, say you' stuck in traffic and try to call as soon as you get there. Offer to wait outside the door until they're ready. Then leave the road and go through town on side streets. It'll take longer but you' get there. You' got this. Offer to wait outside the room and call the couple as soon as you get there. They' appreciate you being responsible.",
